"title": "rabbi",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "rabbi",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><b>Rabai</b> em i nem we ol manmeri insait long <a href=\"#t74\">Israel</a> i givim long wanpela <a href=\"#t136\">tisa</a> bilong lotu. Insait long tok ples bilong ol, dispela wod em i minim &quot;bikpela bilong mi,&quot; o &quot;nambawan tisa bilong mi.&quot; Taim wanpela man o meri i kolim narapela man o meri olsem &quot;Rabai,&quot; ol i wok long givim dispela man o meri rispek. Sampela trenslesen i kipim dispela wod &quot;Rabai,&quot; na ol narapela trenslesen i tok tasol olsem &quot;tisa.&quot;</p><p><b>Taim yu wok long trensletim &quot;Rabai&quot;, yu mas lukaut long ol dispela samting:</b></p><p>Yu ken yusim wanpela wod o hap tok insait long tok ples bilong yu we i minim &quot;tisa.&quot; Tasol dispela wod em i mas no ken wanpela wod we ol i save yusim tasol long ol tisa bilong pikinini insait long wanpela skul.</p>",
